  "body": "Found while documenting the CLI (#1251, PR #1294): `camcraft-cli script --help`, `process --help` and `mcp --help` are errors; only the top-level `help` prints usage.\n\nDone means: each subcommand accepts `--help`/`-h`, prints its own usage (arguments, flags such as process's `-o` and `--cps`) and exits 0; pinned in the cli test suite; the CLI docs page updated.\n",
